    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Visual and interactive design studio founded in Paris in 2007 by Patrick Paleta and Stephane Buellet (both art directors); team of ~5 as of 2022 including a studio manager, interactive designer, and visual designer. Practice spans graphic design, identity, edition, signage, interactive installations, generative tools, and custom type; known for algorithmic/generative visual systems at the intersection of art and technology. Lumen Prize (2014) and European Design Awards (2014, 2019). Fully autonomous independent studio, 19+ years; Autonomy 5.",
